data_on_this_dictionary
    _dictionary_name            cif_dft.dic
    _dictionary_version         0.002
    _dictionary_update          2013-08-17
    _dictionary_history
;
2013-08-17 Adding two additional data names to describe custom names of
           alloy methods and XC functional types if their enumerator 
           values are givem as 'other'. S.G.

2013-08-17 Adding all datanames from Bj\"orkman Torbj\"orn's 2013-05-09
           11:23 e-mail. S.G.

2013-08-17 Adding an empty CIF scaffold for the DFT dictionary. S.G.
;

data_dft_software_package
    _name '_dft_software_package'
    _type char
    _definition
; Software package used to compute and produce the DFT-computed structure file.
  Only package or program name should be used, e.g. 'WASP', 'psi3', etc.
;

data_dft_software_package_version
    _name '_dft_software_package_version'
    _type char
_definition
; Software package version used to compute and produce the DFT-computed 
  structure file. Only version designator should be used, e.g. '3.4.0',
  '2.1rc3'. It is desireable that the combination of the _dft_software_package
  and _dft_software_package_version values would uniquely identify the code
  that was used for computations.
;

data_dft_software_operating_system
    _name '_dft_software_operating_system'
    _type char
    _definition
; Operating system used to compute and produce the DFT-computed structure file.
  Only OS name should be used, e.g. 'Irix', 'Windows XP', 'Ubuntu GNU/Linux',
  etc.
;

data_dft_software_operating_system_version
    _name '_dft_software_operating_system_version'
    _type char
    _definition
; Operating system version used to compute and produce the
  DFT-computed structure file.  Only version designator should be
  used, e.g. '3.4.0', '2.1rc3'. It is desireable that the combination
  of the _dft_software_operating_system and
  _dft_software_package_operating_system_version values would uniquely
  identify the OS that was used for computations.
;

data_dft_software_runtime_CPU
    _name '_dft_software_runtime_CPU'
    _type char
    _definition
; Name (type) of the central processing unit (CPU), together with the 
  floating-point processing unit, that was used to compute the results.
;

data_dft_software_runtime_CPU_version
    _name '_dft_software_runtime_CPU_version'
    _type char
    _definition
; Version or release number of the central processing unit (CPU),
  together with the floating-point processing unit, that was used to 
  compute the results.
;

